        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Punjab Alienation of Land Act, 1900</p>",
            "<p>Prevented transfer of agricultural land to non-agricultural communities; passed by Viceroy Curzon</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
