          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Partition of India (1947)</p>",
            "<p>Punjab was partitioned between India and Pakistan; massive communal violence; 6–12 million displaced; Radcliffe Line drew the boundary</p>"
          ]
        }
